      "correctOptionId": "F",
      "correctAnswerLatex": "x=(5y+2)/3;\\ T=117",
      "workedSolutionSteps": [
        "Inverse x=(5y+2)/3. Integer y occurs at x=4,9,14,...; integer z at odd x, so common x=9,19,29,...,99.",
        "z−y=(19−x)/10. The given interval is equivalent to 29≤x≤49.",
        "Only29,39,49 qualify; T117."
      ],
