      "stem": "P is the intersection of $y=x+1$ and $y=3x-5$. Reflect P in the y-axis, then move the reflected point vertically up by h units, with h>0. The line through this point parallel to $y=-2x+7$ meets the x-axis at Q. The line through P parallel to $y=x$ meets the x-axis at T. Q is 3 units to the right of T. Find h and the y-intercept of the line through Q parallel to $y=-2x+7$.",
